@startuml cgms_power_state_machine
title CGMS Power Management – State Machine

[*] --> Shipping

Shipping --> Off : device shipped
Off --> Idle : sensor activated

Idle --> Sampling : scheduled sample
Sampling --> Idle : sample complete

Idle --> LowPower : battery < LOW_THRESHOLD
Sampling --> LowPower : battery < LOW_THRESHOLD

LowPower --> Sampling : reduced-rate sample
Sampling --> LowPower : sample complete

LowPower --> Critical : battery < CRITICAL_THRESHOLD
Critical --> Shutdown : safety timeout reached

Idle --> Charging : external power detected
LowPower --> Charging : external power detected
Critical --> Charging : external power detected

Charging --> Idle : battery charged
Charging --> Sampling : immediate sample request

Shutdown --> [*]

note right of Sampling
Normal operation:
- Full sampling rate
- BLE notifications enabled
end note

note right of LowPower
Mitigations:
- Reduced sampling rate
- Suppress non-critical BLE traffic
- Power telemetry enabled
end note

note right of Critical
Safety mode:
- No glucose automation
- Persistent user alert
- Diagnostics only
end note

note right of Charging
Behavior:
- Suspend non-essential tasks
- Resume safely after charge
end note

@enduml
